⚡🇷🇺🇮🇷The Russian Embassy:We have seen reports published in some hostile media outlets claiming  that the evacuation of Russian Embassy staff and experts working at the Bushehr Nuclear Power Plant is currently underway.

 In this context, we declare that the Russian Embassy staff and experts working at the Bushehr Nuclear Power Plant are not leaving Iran. Activities are continuing as normal. Claims to the contrary are disinformation, and their source is well known.

